<title>USA: BSB Bancorp raises cash dividend post split.</title>
<headline>BSB Bancorp raises cash dividend post split.</headline>
<dateline>BINGHAMTON, N.Y. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BSB Bancorp Inc said Monday it declared a 3-for-2 stock split, and increased its quarterly dividend to $0.20 per share adjusted to the split.</p>
<p>The company last dividend was $0.25 per share. This new dividend, the company said is a 20 percent increase.</p>
<p>The stock split is payable on September 10 to shareholders of record at the close of business on August 21. The dividend is payable on a post-split basis on September 10 to shareholders of record August 22.</p>
<p>BSB Bancorp is the bank holding company for BSB Bank &amp; Trust Co.</p>
